[158.604705, "o", "\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:35 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K preflight on sdfmilan176 (sdfmilan176.sdf.slac.stanford.edu) job=43817664 step=1 user=cwang31\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:35 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K OS: Rocky Linux 9.6 (Blue Onyx)  kernel 5.14.0-570.58.1.el9_6.x86_64\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:35 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K device check: ls /dev/datadev* /dev/pcie_adc* /dev/tpr* 2>&1\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:35 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K isolation env\r\n"]
[158.604983, "o", "\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:35 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K 1. HTTPS to pswww through the env (must FAIL)\r\n09:25:35 curl \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K7 (0 would mean pswww answered)\r\n09:25:35 python-requests \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K0 (1 would mean pswww answered)\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:35 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K 1b. without the proxy env, would the node route to pswww? (local lookup only, no packet sent)\r\n"]
[158.605445, "o", "\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:35 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K 2. pvget (pvAccessCPP) of a production-looking PV (must time out)\r\nDAQ:NEH:XPM:0:PART:5:Master 09:25:40 pvget \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K1\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:40 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K 2b. p4p (pvxs) client get, as control.py uses (must time out)\r\n09:25:47 p4p \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K0\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:47 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K 3. caget of a production-looking PV (must time out)\r\n09:25:52 caget \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K1\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:52 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K 4. POSITIVE CONTROL: softIocPVA on loopback with the same env (must SUCCEED)\r\nSIMW3:\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPREFLIGHT\u001b[m\u001b[K:VAL <undefined>              \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K42.5\u001b[m\u001b[K \r\nSIMW3:\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPREFLIGHT\u001b[m\u001b[K:VAL            \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K42.5\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\np4p local get: \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K42.5\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n09:25:57 local pvget \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K0 caget \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K0 p4p \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Krc=\u001b[m\u001b[K0\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[K09:25:57 ===\u001b[m\u001b[K summary: leak=0 positive_control_fail=0\r\n09:25:57 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPREFLIGHT\u001b[m\u001b[K PASS\r\n\u001b]0;cwang31@sdfmilan176:/sdf/scratch/lcls/ds/prj/prjcwang31/scratch/main/agentify-lcls2/redo/wt-a1\u0007"]
